sequenceDiagram
    participant Customer
    participant EmailProcessor as Email Processing
    participant Classifier as Ai Classification
    participant Router as Routing
    participant Agent as Subscription Agent
    participant WooCommerce as WooCommerce
    participant Stripe as Stripe Billing
    participant AiAssistant as Ai Assistant
    participant Approver as Approval Queue
    participant Responder as Response System

    Note over Customer,Responder: Email Processing (Subscription Agent)

    Customer->>EmailProcessor: Send Email (Subscription Modification)
    EmailProcessor->>EmailProcessor: Receive via Gmail Push/Sync/Manual
    EmailProcessor->>Classifier: Extract & Normalize Content
    Classifier->>Classifier: Run GPT-4o Classification (subscription_changes + Confidence)
    Classifier->>Classifier: Run Amazon Comprehend Sentiment Analysis
    Classifier->>Router: Classified Email
    Router->>Agent: Route to Subscription Agent (if confidence >=60%)
    alt Confidence <60% or Complex Request
        Router->>AiAssistant: Escalate to Ai Assistant
    end
    Agent->>Agent: Extract Subscription ID (AI Pattern Matching)
    alt No Subscription ID
        Agent->>WooCommerce: Lookup by Customer Email
        alt No Active Subscription
            Agent->>AiAssistant: Escalate to Ai Assistant
            Agent->>Customer: Notify No Subscription Found
        end
    end
    Agent->>WooCommerce: Validate Subscription (Active, Email Match)
    alt Invalid Subscription
        Agent->>AiAssistant: Escalate to Ai Assistant
    end
    Agent->>Agent: Determine Action (Pause/Resume/Cancel/Modify)
    Agent->>WooCommerce: Execute Action (Update Subscription)
    alt Modify Action
        Agent->>Stripe: Update Billing Schedule
    end
    alt Safety Check Failure (e.g., Payment Method, Product Availability)
        Agent->>AiAssistant: Escalate to Ai Assistant
        Agent->>Customer: Notify Issue (e.g., Expired Card, Discontinued Product)
    end
    alt Automation Approval Required
        Agent->>Approver: Queue for Review (Action Details, Customer Context, Metadata)
        Approver->>Responder: Approve & Proceed
    end
    Responder->>Customer: Send Response (Confirmation: Pause/Resume/Cancel)
    Note over Agent,Responder: Log Steps, Maintain Audit Trail
    alt Errors (API Failure, System Error)
        Agent->>AiAssistant: Escalate with Priority
        Agent->>Customer: Notify Error/Service Unavailable
    end
